Jr.","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/iFPjg94U6LFZnp6oaN1Twift0Hn.jpg","tmdbId":1223737},{"name":"Jeff Lindsay","character":"Jeff Lindsay","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/eKe6NuZfCqik9AyMvjdedE1skz4.jpg","tmdbId":1223918}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QiLD7QXx3kB4ZgWyBHAH9YCxpo.jpg","https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRD9kvYLbySRvtt9Nh7QK6XECZX.jpg","https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2Oyi3boT100bY5kCP4MBiTeetO.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt33043892:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Latido","overview":"Dexter Morgan despierta de un coma de diez semanas. Durante una dolorosa recuperación se entera que su hijo huyo a Nueva York.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cdxZjP0S2K1FGO3NiXbQAM6TqwS.jpg","released":"2025-07-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"52 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Tímido Ante La Cámara","overview":"En Nueva York, Dexter se integra a la comunidad de viajes compartidos para rastrear a un asesino en serie. Harrison se ve arrastrado por la culpa de un arrebato violento.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gxTEgknl8AequxdxtkLHOMFN5T3.jpg","released":"2025-07-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Órdenes De Copiloto","overview":"Siguiendo buscando al asesino en serie, Dexter debe equilibrar cuidadosamente los intentos de Blessing Kamara de ayudarlo a aclimatarse. Mientras tanto, Harrison se involucra más profundamente en la investigación policial.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yVtgDRQDFbQ7EMhpFfqhWHzyH5J.jpg","released":"2025-07-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"52 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Llámame \"Red\"","overview":"Dexter asiste a una misteriosa reunión, organizada por una figura muy influyente con ambiciones macabras. Harrison continúa luchando con la creciente culpa y presión en el trabajo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c1sOxW3Xr6tAu11Gkqzq0ZaVSDp.jpg","released":"2025-07-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"67 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Hormona asesina","overview":"Un encuentro empuja a Harrison aún más hacia su propia oscuridad, aumentando su miedo a ser arrestado. Mientras tanto, Batista se acerca y Dexter persigue una peligrosa conexión con un seductor asesino, creyendo que operan bajo un código similar.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nEehUPK1SB6wzjVBOIdPi84CMsb.jpg","released":"2025-08-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"50 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"El gato y el ratón","overview":"Mientras Dexter se acerca a un asesino narcisista, Harrison enfrenta una crisis de identidad al intentar encontrar su lugar en el mundo. Batista persigue la conexión entre el Carnicero de la Bahía y los recientes asesinatos en Nueva York.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sWBM9e5YQLVflxV17puSOlKA7wk.jpg","released":"2025-08-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Corrección de Rumbo","overview":"Dexter descubre información inquietante y Harrison contempla su futuro.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lZPs7ZVXnbhgdaW1bU0mReubEDf.jpg","released":"2025-08-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"La Sala de Asesinatos Donde Sucede","overview":"Dexter redirige su atención para ser un mejor padre. Claudette investiga el pasado tumultuoso de Miami Metro, acercándose a la verdad. Mientras, Prater descubre información que podría poner a Harrison en grave peligro.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oNF42UdW8L6P3aBz96Ens0mE0fF.jpg","released":"2025-08-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Tocado por Angel","overview":"Prater y Charley revelan que conocen una información crucial, lo que obliga a Dexter a tomar medidas extremas. Sin embargo, mientras Dexter intenta concertar una reunión con Prater, Harrison se ve cada vez más envuelto en la trama.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mQUCZxHgcjMe5KTLioBoQbEXn5Q.jpg","released":"2025-08-31T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Y Justicia para Todos...","overview":"La lealtad de Charley hacia Prater llega al límite, lo que le obliga a tomar una decisión. Dexter y Harrison se enfrentan en una confrontación final, asumiendo las consecuencias de su oscuridad. Final de temporada.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gHuIndo51r3cyA1UwYiEYAcXEbo.jpg","released":"2025-09-07T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"Negocio arriesgado","overview":"Dexter lucha por encontrar un propósito más allá de la caza mientras Harrison comienza su carrera en el NYPD. Un nuevo asesino descarado pone a la ciudad en alerta.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iOxWqj1jM5ROPvlfKYHqvONdqVi.jpg","released":"2026-11-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"50 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"Fallen","overview":"Navigating his mid-life crisis, Dexter finds no comfort as the Five Borough Killer captivates New York City. Meanwhile, his son Harrison starts at NYPD Homicide.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oRr8xKcJvgFihuQWRmrszL85kt7.jpg","released":"2026-11-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"Young Blood","overview":"Dexter closes in on a ruthless killer terrorizing the city, but a fleeting clue is all he has to go on. Harrison settles into his new role at NYPD.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kbfPiCofpWEnWM9fK8tlZ2YcRvt.jpg","released":"2026-11-15T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"Live Free and Die","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tAX9ecuUfYMwoJZsQlx7yua5yDw.jpg","released":"2026-11-22T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"Panic Attack","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a7Ofz6lgowoSVajts2FhhQOpNJK.jpg","released":"2026-11-29T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Out of the Past","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7mkEnm06lbOAYgWUb04gTJTgKUI.jpg","released":"2026-12-06T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:7","season":2,"episode":7,"title":"Rule Number One","released":"2026-12-13T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:8","season":2,"episode":8,"title":"Game On","released":"2026-12-20T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:9","season":2,"episode":9,"title":"Credit Where Credit is Due","released":"2026-12-27T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt33043892:2:10","season":2,"episode":10,"title":"Now You See Me","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e08ZoQpSWCraTQlwYBKJo6sdwmj.jpg","released":"2027-01-03T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt33043892:0:1","season":0,"episode":1,"title":"Dexter Reawakened","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tLjsB8eTB3EGMegxPNwoanPdcZM.jpg","released":"2026-02-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"21 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:0:2","season":0,"episode":2,"title":"The Code Lives On","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1wl6WQi2i8UmkNpHbjs5RV8EkCC.jpg","released":"2026-02-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"5 min"},{"id":"tt33043892:0:3","season":0,"episode":3,"title":"Father, Son, and the Dark Passenger","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/41m7Ce5Bxgj2roaZ5ZEneGCIazI.jpg","released":"2026-02-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"9 min"}]}}